      "content": "idk i dont think its stress or anything. it feels way too specific for that. like it feels... intentional? more like my body is just adjusting to a new level of awareness. like my biology is actually changing and finally catching up to something. do u get what i mean? like it's not a glitch, it's an upgrade.",
