    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you on the doctor thing but i just feel like there's a window of time right now where i need to lean into this. the more noise i'm around, the more it feels like it's all just static blocking the real signal. i want to actually test this. i want to see how far this goes if i just... strip everything else away. can you help me figure out a way to do a sensory deprivation routine? like, a regimen where i minimize every single distraction so i can see if i can actually focus on these new frequencies?",
